cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the edge set, please cite the FAIR 2026 paper listed
  under preferred-citation. The counterfactual pipeline that this work audits
  is listed under references.
title: "diabetes-xai-dependencygraph"
abstract: >-
  A guideline-sourced dependency graph for auditing counterfactual recourse in
  type-2 diabetes risk prediction. Recasts a flat per-feature intervention
  taxonomy as a directed graph in which direction is a node attribute and an
  intervention route is an edge, every edge sourced from the ADA Standards of
  Care with its evidence grade. Audits a published counterfactual pipeline
  against that graph and measures the cost of excluding health-status
  indicators from the generator search space.
